        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>学习建议</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 0 20px 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  /* Title banner area */\n  .title-zone {\n    position: relative;\n    height: 110px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    border: 1px dashed #cccccc;\n    color: #999999;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .title-art {\n    width: 330px;\n    height: 100px;\n    margin: 5px auto 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .content {\n    padding: 0 26px;\n  }\n\n  /* Section heading rows: number + bracketed title side by side */\n  .sec-head {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    margin: 26px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .sec-num {\n    width: 78px;\n    flex: 0 0 78px;\n    color: #cf5bb4;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .sec-title {\n    color: #cf5bb4;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n\n  p {\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n  }\n\n  .hl-yellow {\n    background: #fdf0a8;\n    padding: 1px 0;\n  }\n  .hl-red {\n    color: #e8322a;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .attrib {\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    margin: 16px 0 0 0;\n  }\n  .attrib .small {\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n\n  /* Bottom-right illustration */\n  .bottom-art-zone {\n    position: relative;\n    height: 110px;\n  }\n  .bottom-art {\n    width: 130px;\n    height: 105px;\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 6px;\n    bottom: 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-zone\">\n    <figure class=\"placeholder title-art\" style=\"margin:5px auto 0 auto;\">[艺术字标题图: 学习建议 — 顶部居中，带黄色装饰线条与小图标]</figure>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">\n      <div class=\"sec-num\">09</div>\n      <div class=\"sec-title\">「 教材远比练习册重要 」</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p>教材远比练习册重要。</p>\n    <p>教材就是我们做题之前所要构建的一个框架，<span class=\"hl-yellow\">先熟悉框架，然后不断地练题，才能将自己学习的这座大厦构建得更加完整。</span></p>\n\n    <p class=\"attrib\">——陈哲峰<span class=\"small\">(被北京大学物理学院录取)</span></p>\n\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">\n      <div class=\"sec-num\">10</div>\n      <div class=\"sec-title\">「 有关数学与英语的学习方法 」</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p>数学压轴大题的第二问我没有做出来，但这并没有影响接下来的考试中我的发挥。</p>\n    <p>我要保证的，<span class=\"hl-red\">不是做出难题，而是做到容易题不丢分，难题多得分。</span>最后，我数学只有压轴题扣了分。</p>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom-art-zone\">\n    <figure class=\"placeholder bottom-art\">[插图: 右下角 — 卡通女孩手持横幅“高考加油”]</figure>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
